        "answer": {
          "short": "$c=\\frac{2+\\sqrt{13}}3$ or $\\frac{2-\\sqrt{13}}3$; $c\\approx1.869$ or $-0.5352$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3c^2-4c-3&=0\\\\\\Delta&=(-4)^2-4(3)(-3)\\\\\\Delta&=52\\\\c&=\\frac{4\\pm\\sqrt{52}}6\\\\c&=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt{13}}3\\\\c&\\approx1.869\\text{ or }-0.5352\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
