        "answer": {
          "short": "$t=\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}4$ or $\\frac{1-\\sqrt5}4$; $t\\approx0.8090$ or $-0.3090$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4t^2-2t-1&=0\\\\\\Delta&=(-2)^2-4(4)(-1)\\\\\\Delta&=20\\\\t&=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt{20}}8\\\\t&=\\frac{1\\pm\\sqrt5}4\\\\t&\\approx0.8090\\text{ or }-0.3090\\end{align*}$$",
